				This license covers both apps' original source code. Bundled
				third-party assets (typefaces, mystery illustrations, Scripture
				sources) carry their own separate licenses — see the in-app About
				screen for details.
			</p>
		</section>

		<footer>
			<p>
				&copy; 2026 David Kaluta &middot; <a href="/">Home</a> &middot;
				<a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
